{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>港鐵周六「感謝日」　用八達通或樂悠咭享半價</strong></p><p>・港鐵將於周六推出感謝日<br>・八達通可享車費半價<br>・樂悠咭乘客同樣享優惠<br>・優惠方便乘客乘搭港鐵</p><p>暫時未能從am730擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.am730.com.hk/本地/1059742/港鐵周六-感謝日-用八達通或樂悠咭享半價\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:39.964994+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:42:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.629557+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.629557+00:00","content_hash":"9cb6d5a2a21f0303493e0777cbc08e9c7da1f37d731d16862cd79c686482e129","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}